# LLM Sentinel

Autonomous security evaluation and runtime defense platform for LLM agents.

## Status

Architecture and design phase.

## Documentation

- [Project Charter](docs/00-project-charter.md)
- [Requirements Specification](docs/01-requirements.md)
- [Threat Model](docs/02-threat-model.md)
- [System Architecture](docs/03-architecture.md)

## Planned capabilities

- automated LLM red teaming
- adaptive multi-step attack evaluation
- RAG security testing
- tool and MCP security testing
- runtime defense evaluation
- multi-model benchmarking
- reproducible security experiments

## Safety

All offensive evaluation is designed for controlled, synthetic, isolated targets.
